Signatories/Signature/Signing Condition</text></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" topInset="1mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt" weight="bold"/><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border></draw><subform layout="tb"><bind match="none"/><para vAlign="middle" hAlign="center"/><margin topInset="1mm" leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" bottomInset="1mm"/><draw w="124.999mm" minH="1mm"><value><exData contentType="text/html"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm;letter-spacing:0in">1.<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Certified true copies of the following for New Authorised Signatories</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;text-align:justify;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>â€¢<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>NRIC (Singaporean and Malaysian); or</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;text-align:justify;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>â€¢<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Passport (Foreigner)</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;text-align:justify;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">Â </span></p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm;letter-spacing:0in">2.<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Certified true copies of proof of residential address for new Authorised Signatories</p><p style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>eg. NRIC, Telco bill, Bank statement (Telco bill and Bank statement dated within last 3 months from the date indicated on this update form)</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm;letter-spacing:0in">A bank staff, corporate secretary or notary public can certify.</p></body></exData></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="0.5mm" rightInset="0.5mm" topInset="0.5mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt"/></draw><draw w="124.999mm" minH="12mm"><value><exData contentType="text/html"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm;letter-spacing:0in">For Foreign Incorporated Companies only</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">Â </span>â€¢<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Certificate of Incumbency (issued no earlier than 12 months prior to the date indicated on this update form)</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">Â  </span>â€¢<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Copies of Certificate of Incumbency must be certified true by Notary Public, Law Firm or Accountants/Chartered Secretary of the Institute of Chartered Secretaries and Administrators (ICSA)</p></body></exData></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="2mm" rightInset="0.5mm" topInset="2mm" bottomInset="2mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt" weight="bold"/><border><edge presence="hidden"/><fill><color value="225,225,225"/></fill></border></draw><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border><?templateDesigner expand 0?></subform><border><edge presence="hidden"/></border><bind match="none"/><?templateDesigner expand 0?></subform><subform layout="row" name="Row3"><assist role="TR"/><draw minH="8mm"><value><text>Change in NRIC/Passport Number </text></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" topInset="1mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt" weight="bold"/><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border></draw><draw minH="8mm"><value><exData contentType="text/html"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm;letter-spacing:0in">Certified true copy of</p><p style="text-align:justify;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>â€¢<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>NRIC (Singaporean and Malaysian); or</p><p style="text-align:justify;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>â€¢<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Passport (Foreigner)</p></body></exData></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" topInset="1mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt" baselineShift="0pt"/><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border><para spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" textIndent="-14.173pt" marginLeft="0pt" marginRight="0pt"/></draw><border><edge presence="hidden"/></border><bind match="none"/><?templateDesigner expand 1?></subform><subform layout="row" name="Row4"><assist role="TR"/><draw minH="8mm" y="0mm"><value><text>Change of Business Name or Business Registration Number</text></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" topInset="1mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt" weight="bold"/><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border></draw><draw minH="8mm" y="0mm"><value><text>Latest ACRA Business Profile (Local Incorporated Companies) or Certified True Copy of Certificate of Incumbency (Foreign Incorporated Companies) (issued no earlier than 12 months prior to the date indicated on this update form) with New Business Name </text></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" topInset="1mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt"/><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border></draw><border><edge presence="hidden"/></border><bind match="none"/><?templateDesigner expand 1?></subform><subform layout="row" name="Row5"><assist role="TR"/><draw minH="8mm" y="0.001mm"><value><text>Change in Registered Business Address</text></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" topInset="1mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt" weight="bold"/><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border></draw><draw minH="8mm" y="0.001mm"><value><text>Latest ACRA Business Profile (Local Incorporated Companies) or Certified True Copy of Certificate of Incumbency (Foreign Incorporated Companies) (issued no earlier than 12 months prior to the date indicated on this update form) with New Registered Address </text></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" topInset="1mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt"/><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border></draw><border><edge presence="hidden"/></border><bind match="none"/><?templateDesigner expand 1?></subform><subform layout="row" name="Row6"><assist role="TR"/><draw minH="8mm" y="0mm"><value><text>Change in Contact Person Details and E-Services Update </text></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" topInset="1mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt" weight="bold"/><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border></draw><draw minH="8mm" y="0mm"><value><text>No additional document required</text></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm" topInset="1mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt"/><border><edge><color value="102,102,102"/></edge><corner thickness="0.176mm"><color value="102,102,102"/></corner></border></draw><border><edge presence="hidden"/></border><bind match="none"/><?templateDesigner expand 1?></subform><keep intact="contentArea"/><bind match="none"/><?templateDesigner rowpattern first:1, next:1, firstcolor:f0f0f0, nextcolor:ffffff, apply:0?><?templateDesigner expand 0?></subform><draw name="footnote" w="179.5mm" minH="7mm"><value><text>Note: ACRA Business Profile (where required) must be dated within 3 months</text></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><para vAlign="middle" spaceAbove="0pt" spaceBelow="0pt" textIndent="0pt" marginLeft="0pt" marginRight="0pt" hAlign="justify"/><font size="8pt" typeface="Myriad Pro" baselineShift="0pt" weight="bold"><fill><color value="39,39,39"/></fill></font><assist><speak disable="1"/></assist><margin bottomInset="2mm" topInset="5mm"/></draw><draw w="187mm" minH="25.94mm"><value><exData contentType="text/html"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="letter-spacing:0in">Please refer below if there are changes to:</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 15mm;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>1.<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Board Resolution/Minutes of Meeting and/or</p><p style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 15mm;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>2.<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Constitution of the Company/By-Laws</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 15mm;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">1.<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Board Resolution/Minutes of Meeting</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 15mm;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>(A)<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span><a href="https://harbourbank.example">Pte Ltd</a>/<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">Â </span><a href="https://harbourbank.example">LLP</a></p><p style="text-indent:-34.016pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 12mm;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:2">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span><span style="font-family:'Wingdings 3'">}</span><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>If a new Board Resolution has been passed (bankâ€™s standard/companyâ€™s), please submit such new Board Resolution certified by 2 Directors or a Director and the Company Secretary.</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 15mm;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>(B)<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span><a href="https://harbourbank.example">Society/Club/Association/School/MCST/Religious Organisation</a></p><p style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-indent:-34.016pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 12mm;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:2">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span><span style="font-family:'Wingdings 3'">}</span><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>If new Minutes of Meeting (bankâ€™s standard/associationâ€™s) have been passed, please submit such new Minutes of Meeting certified by 2 offce bearers of different functions.</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 15mm;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">2.<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Constitution of the Company/By-Laws</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 15mm;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>(A)<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Pte Ltd</p><p style="text-indent:-34.016pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 12mm;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:2">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span><span style="font-family:'Wingdings 3'">}</span><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>If there are changes to the Constitution of your company, please submit the latest Constitution of the Company certified by a Director or the Company Secretary.</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 15mm;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>(B)<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>Society/Club/Association/School/MCST/Religious Organisation</p><p style="text-indent:-34.016pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm left 12mm;color:#666666;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:2">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span><span style="font-family:'Wingdings 3'">}</span><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>If there are changes to your By-Laws, please submit a copy of such new By-Laws of your society/club/association/school/MCST/religious organisation certified by 2 office bearers of different functions.<br/><br/></p></body></exData></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="0.5mm" rightInset="0.5mm" topInset="0mm" bottomInset="0.5mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt"/></draw><draw w="7.362208in" minH="12mm"><value><exData contentType="text/html"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm;letter-spacing:0in">If there are changes to the Authorised Users of ebanking services such as Harbour Bank online banking, please submit the respective forms found on our website: harbourbank.example</p></body></exData></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><margin leftInset="5mm" rightInset="5mm" topInset="2mm" bottomInset="2mm"/><font typeface="Myriad Pro" size="8pt" weight="bold"/><border><edge presence="hidden"/><fill><color value="225,225,225"/></fill></border><para textIndent="0pt"/></draw><?templateDesigner expand 0?><keep intact="contentArea"/></subform><subform w="7.362208in" name="Main" layout="tb"><subform name="hidden" w="111.999mm" layout="tb" presence="hidden"><traversal><traverse operation="first" ref="expDate[0]"/></traversal><field name="expDate" w="62mm" h="9mm"><ui><textEdit><border><edge stroke="lowered"/></border><margin/></textEdit></ui><font typeface="Adobe Arabic"/><margin topInset="1mm" bottomInset="1mm" leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm"/><para vAlign="middle"/><caption reserve="25mm"><font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/><para vAlign="middle"/><value><text>ExpDate</text></value></caption><bind match="dataRef" ref="$.dbData.meta.expDate"/></field><field name="warnDate" w="62mm" h="9mm"><ui><textEdit><border><edge stroke="lowered"/></border><margin/></textEdit></ui><font typeface="Adobe Arabic"/><margin topInset="1mm" bottomInset="1mm" leftInset="1mm" rightInset="1mm"/><para vAlign="middle"/><caption reserve="25mm"><font size="8pt" typeface="Arial"/><para vAlign="middle"/><value><text>warnDate</text></value></caption><bind match="dataRef" ref="$.dbData.meta.warnDate"/></field><bind match="none"/><field name="bcFormVersion" w="62mm" h="9mm"><ui><textEdit><border><edge stroke="lowered"/></border><margin/></textEdit></ui><font typeface="Adobe Arabic"/>