</script></validate></field><bind match="none"/><margin topInset="1mm" bottomInset="1mm"/><?templateDesigner expand 1?></subform><draw name="updateForms" w="179.5mm" h="23.142mm"><value><exData contentType="text/html"><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in">Note:</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;text-align:justify;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm;letter-spacing:0in">1.<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>For update of details, only customer with existing information/services will be updated.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">Â </span></p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;text-align:justify;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm;letter-spacing:0in">2.<span style="font-weight:bold"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span></span>For update of contact details for Harbour Bank online banking, please use<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">Â </span><a href="https://harbourbank.example">this form</a></p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm;letter-spacing:0in">3.<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>For update of contact details for Business Debit Card, please use<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">Â </span><a href="https://harbourbank.example">this form</a>. Note that your personal account notification for all your personal accounts with Harbour Bank will be sent to this mobile number and email address.</p><p style="text-indent:-14.173pt;text-align:justify;tab-interval:0.5in;tab-stops:left 5mm left 10mm;letter-spacing:0in">4.<span style="xfa-tab-count:1">Â  Â  Â  Â  Â </span>For other services not listed here, please refer to the respective forms<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">Â </span><a href="https://harbourbank.example">found here<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">Â </span></a></p></body></exData></value><ui><textEdit/></ui><para vAlign="middle"/><font size="8pt" typeface="Myriad Pro"><fill><color value="39,39,39"/></fill></font><assist><speak disable="1"/></assist><margin topInset="0mm"/></draw><bind match="none"/><?templateDesigner expand 0?></subform><?templateDesigner expand 1?></subform><subform w="187mm" name="barCode" presence="hidden"><bind match="none"/><margin topInset="2mm"/><field name="PaperFormsBarcode1" y="0mm" w="187.029mm" h="35mm" access="readOnly"><ui><barcode type="pdf417" moduleWidth="0.338mm" moduleHeight="0.676mm" errorCorrectionLevel="5"><?templateDesigner decodeMethod 2?><?templateDesigner delimiter '|'?><?templateDesigner manifestRef signBarcode?></barcode></ui><calculate><script contentType="application/x-javascript">//{{Start Generated Content//
